<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Institute Profile Status - EduReview</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2563eb;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .title {
            color: #1f2937;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .status-approved {
            background: #d1fae5;
            border: 1px solid #10b981;
            color: #065f46;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .status-rejected {
            background: #fee2e2;
            border: 1px solid #ef4444;
            color: #991b1b;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background: #1d4ed8;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">🎓 EduReview</div>
            <h1 class="title">Institute Profile Update</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello! 👋</p>
            
            <% if (approved) { %>
                <div class="status-approved">
                    <h2>🎉 Congratulations! Your Institute Profile Has Been Approved!</h2>
                    <p>Your institute is now live on EduReview and students can find and review your institution.</p>
                </div>
                
                <p>What you can do now:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>✅ Manage your institute profile</li>
                    <li>📸 Upload photos and update information</li>
                    <li>💬 Respond to student reviews</li>
                    <li>📊 View analytics and insights</li>
                </ul>
                
                <div style="text-align: center;">
                    <a href="<%= url %>" class="button">🚀 Access Your Dashboard</a>
                </div>
                
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="status-rejected">
                    <h2>❌ Institute Profile Review Update</h2>
                    <p>We're sorry, but your institute profile has not been approved at this time.</p>
                </div>
                
                <p>This could be due to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Incomplete or inaccurate information</li>
                    <li>Missing required documentation</li>
                    <li>Policy violations</li>
                </ul>
                
                <p>Please review your submission and feel free to contact our support team for guidance on how to proceed.</p>
                
                <div style="text-align: center;">
                    <a href="<%= url %>" class="button">📞 Contact Support</a>
                </div>
            <% } %>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Best regards,<br>The EduReview Team 🚀</p>
            <p>If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out to our support team.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 